 <h3><u>woh husain mera hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>woh husain mera hai..<br> zeest jiski baandhi hai, woh husain mera hai<br> Maut jispa marti hai, woh husain mera hai<br> jiski sab khudai hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 1. Kibriya bhi uska hai, ambiya bhi uske hai<br> awsiya bhi uske hai, awliya bhi uske hai<br> khalq saari jiski hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 2. Aisa kiski naami hai, aisa kiska naama hai<br> ek ka sadqa kauna maka, ek arab ki malka hai<br> jo waqar e hasti hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 3. Daadi jiski binte asad, aur jadd abu talib<br> maa hai fatima zahra, baap ka laqab ghalib<br> jo wurude nasli hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 4. Jiske darr par aae malak apni jholiya phailaye<br> jiske darr se fitrus bhi aake baalo par lejaye<br> rizwa jiska darzi hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 5. Jiske daste qudrat me baagh hai nabuwat ki<br> deen ka to kehna kya jab ke khud mashiyat bhi<br> kalma jiska padhti hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 6. Jiske waaste naaqa bangaye ho khud sarwar<br> tool de de sajde ko hukme rab se paighambar<br> jo khuda ki marzi hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 7. Saat(7) bete rahib ko bakhshe apne tiflee me<br> ek habib hi ko kya deen ko zaeefi me<br> jisne zindagi di hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 8. Fikr ummate jadd ki jisko thi tahe khanjar<br> ki tilawate qura'a jisne nauke naiza par<br> deen jisse baqi hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 10. Kuch nahi yaha tafreeq rang o nasl o mazhab ki<br> ek sabka maslak hai ek qaumiyat sabki<br> bazm ye husaini hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 11. Haath katgaye fir bhi behro bar pa qabza hai<br> qabza karke darya par aaj bhi to pyaasa hai<br> jiska aisa bhai hai, woh husain mera hai<br> <br> 12. Jab mulukiyat ki naqaab tifl odh kar aaya<br> jisne barsare darbaar usko be naqaab kiya<br> jiski khwahar aisi hai, wo husain mera hai<br> <br> 13. Sibt e jafar ek shayar, soz khane aale nabi<br> usko izzat o shohrat panjetan ke darr se mili<br> jiska faiz jaari hai, wo husain mera hai</p> 
